    "html": "<tr style=\"height: 89px\"><th id=\"1662574278R82\" style=\"height: 89px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 89px\">83</div></th><td class=\"s14\">Encore</td><td class=\"s15\"><div style=\"width:70px;height:89px;\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xUFjdxJWh4Aq4pkHkb_Lo-xT447huODXo-jeg3Jh7xER9rxCkr-S7Vd3UGwFh6oInIpJosnbi3DtSlSKxH05j9jjFFkJKTdBB43_U7K0sh3yB9yisZqenpCTynOQnwjxejP_nPxJIT-SQ7Cb31BHj93wHtuWYl9oCBG0g=s89-w70-h89\" style=\"width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;\"/></div></td><td class=\"s16\" colspan=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">On </span><span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Weapon Kill</span><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">:<br></span>+5 Range, +8 Stability, and -1.25% Accuracy Cone Size per stack for 7 <span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">↑7.5</span> seconds, up to a maximum of 4 stacks. <span style=\"color:#f1c232;\">Precision Kills</span> grant 2 stacks.<br>Additional Weapon Kills refresh the buff duration.<br><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">Buff persists through stow.</span></td></tr>",
