  "mapping": "Base 7 seconds * 20 TPS = exactly 140 ticks, no rounding; +5 Range/+8 Stability per stack; cone scalar 1 - stacks*0.0125, additive reduction, cap4. Precision kill grants2 total; other kill grants1. All kills refresh140 even at cap. Time continues through stow.",
  "localPolicies": "Paid capture is trusted integration boundary; positive actual final blow required. Original owner/player/level/data/runtime/class/stack/roll identities revalidated; edits/loss/lifecycle revoke epochs. Per-emission corpse identity ledger capped256 fails closed without eviction. Queries pure. Shared master range sums bonuses before 0..100 clamp and raw hip endpoints, then ADS; no handling/reload.",
